       DATA DIVISION.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 1 TO CHK-TOP::Checked
           MOVE 0 TO CHK-BOTTOM::Checked
           MOVE 1 TO CHK-LEFT::Checked
           MOVE 0 TO CHK-RIGHT::Checked
           CALL "ANC-APPLY-LIVE"
]]></Event>
